{"t":"BF-B","made":"2026-11-07 10:12","name":"Brown-Forman Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Wineries & Distilleries","employees":4900,"hq":"Louisville, KY, United States","website":"https://www.brown-forman.com","summary_en":"Brown-Forman Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, distills, bottles, imports, exports, markets, and sells a variety of alcohol beverages. The company provides spirits, wines, whiskey spirits, whiskey-based flavored liqueurs, ready-to-drink cocktails, ready-to-pour products, vodkas, tequilas, gin, brandy, rum, bourbons, and liqueurs. The company offers its products primarily under the Jack Daniel's, Woodford Reserve, Old Forester, Gentleman Jack, Herradura, el Jimador, Fords Gin, The Glendronach, Chambord, Coopers' Craft, Diplomático, Benriach, Glenglassaugh, and Slane brands. It is also involved in the sale of used barrels, and bulk whiskey and wine; and provision of contract bottling services. The company serves retail customers and consumers through distributors and state governments; and retailers, wholesalers, and provincial governments directly. It operates in the United States, Germany, Australia, the United Kingdom, Canada, Spain, France, Mexico, Poland, Brazil, Türkiye, and internationally. Brown-Forman Corporation was founded in 1870 and is headquartered in Louisville, Kentucky.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Brown-Forman Corporation은 자회사와 함께 다양한 알코올 음료를 제조, 증류, 병, 수입, 수출, 시장 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 증류주, 와인, 위스키 증류주, 위스키 기반 향미 리큐어, 바로 마실 수 있는 칵테일, 바로 부어 마실 수 있는 제품, 보드카, 데킬라, 진, 브랜디, 럼, 버번 및 리큐어를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 주로 Jack Daniel's, Woodford Reserve, Old Forester, Gentleman Jack, Herradura, el Jimador, Fords Gin, The Glendronach, Chambord, Coopers' Craft, Diplomático, Benriach, Glenglassaugh 및 Slane 브랜드로 제품을 제공합니다. 또한 중고 통, 대량 위스키 및 와인 판매에도 참여하고 있습니다. 계약 병입 서비스 제공. 회사는 유통업체와 주 정부를 통해 소매 고객과 소비자에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 소매업체, 도매업체, 지방정부가 직접적으로 연락합니다. 미국, 독일, 호주, 영국, 캐나다, 스페인, 프랑스, ​​멕시코, 폴란드, 브라질, 터키 및 국제적으로 운영됩니다. Brown-Forman Corporation은 1870년에 설립되었으며 켄터키주 루이빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":30.58,"mcap":14032068608.0,"pe":19.729033,"fpe":17.842869,"peg":2.3608,"ps":3.5841808,"pb":3.5340345,"ev_ebitda":13.636,"div":2.98,"beta":0.31,"hi52":31.92,"lo52":22.61},"fin":{"rev":3915000064.0,"rev_g":-0.014,"eps_g":0.057,"gross":0.60664004,"op":0.27552,"net":0.18416001,"roe":0.18122,"fcf":685625024.0,"cash":301000000.0,"debt":2440999936.0,"de":61.502,"eps":1.55,"feps":1.71385},"own":{"short":0.11,"inst":0.71765,"insider":0.028010001},"analyst":{"n":17,"mean":28.25882,"median":28.0,"high":35.0,"low":20.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.16667,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":12,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":12,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":13,"sell":2,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-09-04","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":30.0,"priorPriceTarget":27.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-03","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":25.0,"priorPriceTarget":26.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-03","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":29.0,"priorPriceTarget":29.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-03","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":27.0,"priorPriceTarget":27.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-01","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":27.0,"priorPriceTarget":27.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-27","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":